--- !u!114 &1051428927
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1051428925}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4b8e51a640fc514cbba7329d696f3b4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  dialogues:
  - Finally days are longer and I can go out more and stretch my legs! I should probably
    clear the snow a bit
  - I will ask if anybody needs anything
  - " I really should get moving if I am to get to the closest trees! I don\u2019t
    want to walk too far. "
  - 'You are so kind! Now I can rest my knee some more now. '
  - 'I am looking forward to the change of season! I love the way the swans change
    feathers and the lemmings switch colours. '
  - "I saw so many birds flying away! Is quite the spectacle. Those feathers are
    for me?! You shouldn\u2019t have. Thank you so much! "
  - 'How about some berry jam? '
  - 'These berries you are sharing with me will turn into some delicious jam! Come
    by in a couple of days and I will treat you to it! And we can chat some more. '
  - 'I finally got all the Siida Game Jam games! Want to check them out together? '
  - 'Thank you for sharing the adventures with me! I hope they do another Jam like
    that soon! '
  - 'I am so sad that I cannot go berry picking. Could you save some for me? '
  - 'Thank you for taking the time and thinking of me! I miss walking in the forest
    while berry picking. Maybe next time we can go together!? '
  - Do you know that the bark at this time of year is great for dyeing?
  - Fantastic! I will show you the colours that this brings! Thank you.
  - 'I need more roots to practice my crafting. '
  - I am going to become as great a crafter as grandpa! You remember him right?!
  - 'I need to rush to get the bark home, so I am not late for work. '
  - 'You beat me to it! Now I can get out of work in time and start with this sooner!
    I am so happy! '
  - 'I saw the swans fly by! Have you seen any feathers lying around? '
  - Those are for me?! Do you think that swans get itchy when changing?
  - 'The red of the azaleas is so close to my heart! If you see any around, can you
    bring me a bunch? While I am at it, could you get some birch bark? The contrast
    in colours makes for a beautiful centre piece! '
  - 'Look at those colours! This will light up my rooms! Come by and see in a bit,
    you will love it! '
  - 'How I love going around talking to people and into the forest! I feel a stronger
    connection every time I do it. '
  - 'Walking in the forest is so nice. Some peace of mind right there! '
  textBox: {fileID: 1051428928}
--- !u!114 &1051428928
